Z||000006||87ECO5||03-13-2001||07:25 AM||||Chuck - as soon as I get the Flowmaster 40 Series muffler installed, I will try to get a recording of it.<P>Matt - like Terry said, it makes more sense (something I don't have) to spend the money on a V6 car.  I prefer this body style over all the others ("pointy-nose", aero and fastback) so I had the conversion done on it.  Why didn't I just buy a nice Formula?  From what I've read on this forum, parts for the '88 cars are more expensive and getting harder and harder to find.<P>Terry - I'll get to that email today.<P>Brian - no.  The kids will be with us so we'll either have my Pathfinder or Lisa's Sunbird convertible.||||reg||14
